        "0": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "details": "<p>Deals&nbsp;<strong>60 Ice Damage</strong> and inflicts <img src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Skill%20Icon/FFXIVIcons%20Battle(PvE)/BLU/northerlies.png\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\">@UUID[JournalEntry.QgECPH7ZhbRhag3K]{Hypothermia} to all enemy, until the end of the next round, <strong>Clocks&nbsp;</strong>cannot be increase or decrease.</p>\n<p>At the end of the next round when this effects end, all enemy suffering from @UUID[JournalEntry.QgECPH7ZhbRhag3K]{Hypothermia} will be inflict with <img src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Skill%20Icon/FFXIVIcons%20Battle(PvE)/13_BLM/blizzard.png\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\">@UUID[JournalEntry.p0XupN5rieyjMNaI]{Frozen: 100}</p>",
