        "0": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "details": "<p><img src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Skill%20Icon/FFXIVIcons%20Battle(PvE)/07_MNK/purification.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\"><strong>@UUID[JournalEntry.FbwTycwFuAdCfXi7]{Innate}</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"102\" data-end=\"202\">At the start of each <strong data-start=\"157\" data-end=\"166\">Round</strong>, randomly select one action type:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"203\" data-end=\"245\">\n<li data-start=\"203\" data-end=\"217\"><strong data-start=\"205\" data-end=\"215\">Attack</strong></li>\n<li data-start=\"218\" data-end=\"231\"><strong data-start=\"220\" data-end=\"229\">Skill</strong></li>\n<li data-start=\"232\" data-end=\"245\"><strong data-start=\"234\" data-end=\"243\">Spell</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"247\" data-end=\"418\">For the rest of the round, whenever an enemy <strong data-start=\"292\" data-end=\"304\">performs</strong> the chosen action, <strong data-start=\"324\" data-end=\"332\">&Scaron;t&iacute;r</strong> immediately executes a <strong>【⚔️Frost Kick】</strong> against them <strong data-start=\"385\" data-end=\"395\">before</strong> their action resolves. This <strong>Attack&nbsp;</strong>gains +3 bonus&nbsp;<strong>Accuracy.</strong></p>",
