      "stolen_check": false,
      "study_text": "<p>The Empire&rsquo;s High Commissioner. Fights with bladed boots and a magitech whip. Excels at kick combos and locking down foes. Stay mobile to avoid getting trapped and don't let down your offense.</p>",
      "subtype": "Sub-Type",
      "subtype_list": "HUMAN",
      "sword_ef": "100",
      "sword_vu": "NA",
      "tactic_notes": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Stir&nbsp;</strong>core combat combines Locking down opponents with agression, She challenge the player to keep up the offense while dealing with her status effects</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Core Mechanic</strong></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong data-start=\"324\" data-end=\"332\">&Scaron;t&iacute;r&nbsp;</strong>core mechanic revolves around inflicting Freeze on enemy to get damage bonus from her&nbsp;<strong>attacks</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Attack that deals bonus damage to Frozen target</p>\n<ul style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>⚔️Axe Kick </strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>⚔️Scythe Kick&nbsp;</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>⚡️Glacial Ruin </strong>&lt;&lt;&lt; Used when everybody is Frozen</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Attack that Inflicts Frozen on target</p>\n<ul style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>⚔️Frost Kick</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>⚡️Northern Wind</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Combo</strong></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Magitech Claw&nbsp;</strong>and&nbsp;<strong>Guillotine&nbsp;</strong>are attacks that combo into each other. Try to use at least&nbsp;<strong>one&nbsp;</strong>Magitech Claw each turn</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Utility</strong></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong data-start=\"324\" data-end=\"332\">&Scaron;t&iacute;r&nbsp;</strong>Zero Power <strong>💮Subzero Subjugation&nbsp;</strong>doesn't deal as much damage as her normal attacks, but have the powerful effects of&nbsp;<strong>Freezing&nbsp;</strong>all clocks in the scene. Try to chain this skill effect while keeping up the agression with her normal attacks</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\">Passive</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong data-start=\"324\" data-end=\"332\">&Scaron;t&iacute;r&nbsp;</strong>Passive 📜<strong>Absolute Authority </strong>is a utility skill which locks down one of the opponent action each round.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Her Zero Trigger, 📜<strong>Righteous Retribution</strong> combines with 📜<strong>Frostguard</strong> provides her with additional resource each round</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\">Example Turn</h2>\n<ol>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>🏹Magitech Claw</strong>&gt;&gt;&gt;<strong>⚔️Frost Kick</strong>&gt;&gt;&gt;⚔️<strong>Guillotine</strong>&gt;&gt;&gt;<strong>⚔️Kick Attack</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>⚡️Northern Wind&gt;&gt;&gt;⚔️Scythe Kick&gt;&gt;&gt;</strong><strong>⚔️Frost Kick&gt;&gt;&gt;⚔️Axe Kick</strong></li>\n</ol>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Backstory</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>High Commissioner &Scaron;t&iacute;r</strong> was born a hybrid wolf beastmen in a violent, crime-ridden slum where her kind were brutally oppressed. After losing her family to systemic abuse, she vowed to gain power and change the system from within. Hiding her true identity, she rose through the ranks to become the Wiarachia Empire&rsquo;s Head Enforcer.</p>",
